# Overrides the hero background footage.
#
# Unset, the app serves its own public/hero.mp4 — already transcoded for the
# web, so this only needs a value to point somewhere else (a CDN in production)
# or an empty string to drop the video and render the CSS light field instead.
#
# Anything here is public: never put a secret in a VITE_ variable.
#
# If you replace the file, check what it weighs. A background loop lives behind
# a scrim and is never read, so the bitrate a master was graded at buys nothing.
# The original of the shipped clip was 19 MB at 16 Mbit/s; the shipped version
# is 1.9 MB and looks the same underneath the scrim.
VITE_HERO_VIDEO=
